.TH RIVERXIA-SERVER 8 "2026-11-25" "Profile-Website" "System Manager's Manual"
.SH NAME
riverxia-server \- static, paste, and guestbook server
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B LOCAL=1 DIST_DIR=../dist cargo run
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B riverxia-server
serves static files from
.IR DIST_DIR ,
provides a pastebin at
.IR /paste ,
and serves a SQLite-backed guestbook at
.I /api/entries
and
.IR /guestbook/api/entries .
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B PORT
TCP port to listen on (default:
.BR 8000 ).
.TP
.B DIST_DIR
Path to built static assets (default:
.BR dist ).
When invoked from
.IR server/ ,
set
.BR DIST_DIR=../dist .
.TP
.B DB_PATH
Path to SQLite database (default:
.BR .data/riverxia.db ).
.TP
.B LOCAL
Set to
.B 1
for local development (subpath routing such as
.I /paste/
and
.I /guestbook/
instead of subdomain URLs).
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR riverxia (7)
